OL,3,GNEWSAThe night Bexhill turned violent
OL,4,Aover smuggling
OL,5,
OL,6,FLong before the village of Sidley
OL,7,Fbecame part of suburban Bexhill, its
OL,8,Flanes and fields were the setting for
OL,9,Fone of East Sussex's most dramatic
OL,10,Fanti-smuggling confrontations.
OL,12,FIn the early 19th Century, smuggling
OL,13,Fwas rife along much of the East Sussex
OL,14,Fcoast, with the stretch between
OL,15,FHastings and Eastbourne becoming a
OL,16,Froute for goods such as tea, tobacco
OL,17,Fand spirits to come into the country
OL,18,Fand so avoid high taxes.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
