OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAThe night Bexhill turned violent
OL,4,Aover smuggling
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut, smugglers had support of local
OL,7,Fpeople, who saw them as providing
OL,8,Faffordable goods and employment in
OL,9,Fdifficult economic times.
OL,11,FJulian Porter, from Bexhill Museum,
OL,12,Ftold Secret Sussex: "It's an
OL,13,Fagricultural village but smuggling
OL,14,Fcould pay two weeks wages in one go, so
OL,15,Fit was well worth doing."
